      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would it make sense to keep the volume and mute state in single map ?\n```\nclass VolumeAndMute {\nint volume;\nbool mute;\n}\n\nMap\u003cInteger, VolumeAndMute\u003e mGroupVolumeCache; \n```\n\nSince they are always accessed together ?",
